# Claude Code local settings — everything is local EXCEPT the release-engineer
# agent definition, which docs/agents/release-runbook.md declares itself the source
# of truth for. The two must travel together or a fresh clone gets a stale agent.
# Note the `dir/*` form: git cannot re-include a file whose parent dir is excluded.
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/
.claude/agents/*
!.claude/agents/release-engineer.md

